  "behavior": "Expose the existing virtual Material.get_shader_rid native method. No render ordering/wait is removed by the binding. Main prepares the immutable private StandardMaterial shader key; existing leased batch worker then creates the actual material/mesh using candidate09 dirty-queue ordering. Ordinary main creation and shared materials are unchanged.",
