    "map": "road_map10_A1/B1/B2/A2: all normal full-HUD lifecycle checks pass with identical source/map SHA. A2 max main batch commit 430.629ms; B1/B2 15.619/24.033ms. Full readiness 70.245s versus 68.732/70.201s does not establish a large loading gain. Default engine and both private upload flags remain unchanged/off. Candidate10 subsequently installed after editor validation; the recorded ABBA switches are historical.",
